{
  "dom_id": "step-634480",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Given the probability of an event, we can describe the likelihood using words.\n\nEvery probability is a number between ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/156b31ede73de5301befe67f02745a0202f1806a62f9fdecc6fc9ee3f21117ba.svg) and ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/daae2fd3251c4ba175906af980d1c33d4db057c616509ec6a146307d64417228.svg)\nWe use these values to describe how likely an event is:\n\n- If the probability is ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/bb9c53e32535d976b8b3cb9c2ad9e9bcda34d38bb8e09cedb442980f0ea8ac57.svg) the event is **impossible**.\n\n- If the probability is less than ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/9fcebe90d169f37bbdbf55f9e4ac86ceaf6ea6d573d101f382a12008bb0c5c2a.svg) the event is *unlikely*.\n\n- If the probability is ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/9fcebe90d169f37bbdbf55f9e4ac86ceaf6ea6d573d101f382a12008bb0c5c2a.svg) the event is **as equally likely to happen as not**.\n\n- If the probability is close to ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/76543f4805f22715457d55feb2a3c87d0d873bdcb9c1eed7a4f68539269dcf59.svg) the event is **likely**.\n\n- If the probability is ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/76543f4805f22715457d55feb2a3c87d0d873bdcb9c1eed7a4f68539269dcf59.svg) the event is **certain**.\n\n![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/e363496c300e9669e4f2e3f692ddc0c61f5d5d200c8f69a4179031de79173ef9.png)\n\nFor example, suppose the probability of an event is ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/cf1bce8b02fbca4cd31e847e89a56ad3ba80e8601eeb17adbee961164b6bced2.svg)\n\nIn this case, the probability of the event occurring is a relatively large number, closer to ![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/daae2fd3251c4ba175906af980d1c33d4db057c616509ec6a146307d64417228.svg) Since\n![](/tmp/capture-three-errors/source/7221-lesson/assets/c6c112778bee8f51ddca74c9b9c7fa5540100574c0b8848b0268a57716477315.svg)\nthis event is likely.",
